OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the night, with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain and drizzle over the Pennines,
OL,8,Fwhere hill fog is likely to persist.
OL,9,FSome clear spells developing later,
OL,10,Fallowing fog patches to form by the
OL,11,Fmorning. Winds remain light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FFog patches slow to clear
OL,14,Fduring the morning. Cloudy periods
OL,15,Fwith some brighter spells developing
OL,16,Fby the afternoon. Winds remain light
OL,17,Ffor most, but a little stronger along
OL,18,Fthe coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
